Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.82,0:00:10.49,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's Morioh Radio!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.90,0:00:14.95,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}Coming at you once again is yours truly, Kai Harada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.33,0:00:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mariah Mariah Mariah
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.95,0:00:17.03,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}To get you up to speed, last week's topic was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mariah Mariah Mariah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mor
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.03,0:00:23.46,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}"The King of Terror is supposed to come from the sky this July. \NWhat are the citizens of Morioh to do?"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.96,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}All right, let's get to the replies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt, huh? What happened\Nand what's that bag doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.54,0:00:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no it can't be you mean that bag had a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.95,0:01:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ran over a cat! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.26,0:01:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even see it lying there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was no way I could have\Ndodged the poor thing in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly right! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was just a bit of bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like you meant to run it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, if you want my take on the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real scoundrel here is the asswipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who left that poor kitten in a bag to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty rotten, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.64,0:01:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it be the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't hear the little\Nfurball meowing, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's your name, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Tamami Kobayashi,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I just happened to have graduated\Nfrom the same school you're attending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice bike you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are you a freshman?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.88,0:01:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.12,0:01:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Koichi Hirose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.62,0:01:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, that sure takes me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:02:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, have a seat\Nover here, Mr. Hirose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh... but... but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit that punk-ass quivering and sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you're nice and comfy,\NI have a proposition for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll lay that pussycat to rest, and\Nyou grease my palm with some cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.46,0:02:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.07,0:02:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with your ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is serious business!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're innocent and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're not planning to pull a\Nhit-and-run with my precious cat, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.12,0:02:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying that cat belonged to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.94,0:02:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then aren't you the one who stuffed the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kitten inside a bag and\Nleft it in the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not get bogged down in details.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking if you think you're\Ngonna walk away from this scot-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, the killer\Nhere is you, short stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
