Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.50,0:03:57.46,Part 4 OP English,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HB061F6&}{\fad(100,100)}in this Crazy Noisy Bizarre Town!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.51,0:04:12.27,Title Part 4 Episode 2,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(654,476)\pos(130,880)\fs60}Episode 6: {\fs80} Hirose Koichi (Echoes)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're feeling\Npretty guilty right now,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.26,0:04:11.02,Main,Tamami,0,0,0,,{\an8}So, you're probably feeling pretty guilty about this, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the good news is paying\Na little fee could just
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.02,0:04:16.86,Main,Tamami,0,0,0,,{\an8}If spending a little cash would\N free your heart from the shackles of guilt...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,free yourself of that\Noppressive feeling of guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't we begin the healing\Nby emptying out your wallet? Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.53,0:04:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.68,0:04:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like some kind of freaky padlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's really heavy! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying you could actually see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll make things go\Nby a whole lot faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.34,0:04:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean this thing is a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.74,0:04:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is a psycho stand\Ngrowing out of my body?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.19,0:04:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Josuke, you seeing what I'm seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like Koichi's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Koichi, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:04:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter where he goes, he always\Nseems to end up with the wrong crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.34,0:05:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he can handle himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four months ago, I crossed paths with\Na guy by the name of Keicho Nijimura,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he gave me a pretty\Nhandy special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hadn't a clue what was\Nhappening, but it felt great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I figured if I put my\Nnew powers to good use,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never have to worry about a\Nthing for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, cuff it up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being cheap means the lock\Nstays right where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you wouldn't want that, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help you, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.44,0:05:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm flat broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, then explain why you just looked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It got heavier!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tsk, tsk, tsk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't anybody ever teach\Nyou that it's bad to lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admit it or not, you know in\Nyour heart that I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the guiltier you feel, the bigger\Nand heavier that lock will grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:06:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lock's size is proportional\Nto the weight of your guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the two are inexorably linked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can knock me out or\Nrun a thousand miles away,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're never getting\Nrid of that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.56,0:06:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't you be a good\Nboy and give me your wallet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say something\Nabout being flat broke, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks like 7,000 yen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the money I was going to use to\Nbuy new sneakers for gym class today!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, sneakers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could go barefoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.66,0:06:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.98,0:06:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke and Okuyasu, you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like a grown man's\Nmugging a high school kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.74,0:06:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get a job\Nand earn your own money?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, butt out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business, so run along!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not when there's a stinking shitbag in\Nhis dirty little stand in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's time to take out the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.02,0:06:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn thing won't come off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of stand is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.78,0:06:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys could see it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.74,0:07:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many of you freak shows are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took the words right out of my mouth,\Nbut the answer to that question can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till then, I'd appreciate it\Nif you'd remove that lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you assholes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you underestimate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.82,0:07:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch yourselves, because\NI'm not fooling around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.06,0:07:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's essential that criminals\Npay for their crimes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in order to keep society\Nfrom crumbling around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's not going to pay, does that mean\None of you will cover what he owes me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If so, I'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.86,0:07:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Money's money, after all. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you just want to get\Nyour hands on our money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your guard up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.58,0:07:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This loser already\Nswiped 7,000 yen from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because you lied\Nstraight to my face, you dolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think that poor kitty's\Nlife is only worth a measly 7,000 yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You owe me 500 grand, kiddo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,500 grand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet your ass 500...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please shut your hole?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it, Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but easy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had it with your\Nbullshit, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're giving the man his\N7,000 yen back right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we clear?
