Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My front tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why the hell did you stumble around like\Na drunk baby and make yourself fall over?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make myself fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.98,0:08:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you say such a\Nthing after hitting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My poor front tooth has been knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.24,0:08:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stop, Okuyasu. It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't let\Nhim make you feel guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He guilted you on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.00,0:09:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A front tooth will cost me a pretty\Npenny, and I don't have any insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you little... Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do that if I were you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.90,0:09:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone under my locks control\Ntries to hurt me in any way,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the damage will bounce back\Nand hurt my opponent instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, about that kitten\Nyou said Koichi ran over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would this happen to be it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, getting down to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got your tooth right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone! Yeah, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I feel a million times lighter now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you forget about\Nthe 7,000 you stole?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:09:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:09:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hit the road before we\Nkick your smarmy little ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took the bills and only\Nleft the corners behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He grabbed more than enough bills\Nto exchange them at the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a douchebag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll pay, and it's not even my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, easily 7,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they haven't gotten\Nrid of me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.62,0:10:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That rotten morning practically\Nruined my entire day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.88,0:10:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm home, police.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.12,0:10:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't die, did you? Woof, woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.26,0:10:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom, I'm home from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, I've heard\Nquite a lot about you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beautiful, kind, and so refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cross my heart and hope to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this guy in my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why is he massaging\Nmy mom's shoulders?
