Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you have a good day at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked you a question!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.16,0:11:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here? Koichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this gentleman was kind enough to bring us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the money you dropped\Non your way to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,7,000 yen, young man. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You told her you found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you did run into Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kobayashi on your bike today, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.61,0:11:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to make sure you\Ngot your money back, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's the least you could do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you getting so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's another thing I should address,\Nma'am, but it's not easy for me to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem as though\NI too dropped my wallet
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when Koichi mowed me down\Nwith his bike this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny enough, it looks just like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figure in all the confusion earlier,\Nmine was taken in place of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what\NI'm getting at, ma 'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, that seems like quite the\Ncoincidence, but I suppose it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would please tell Koichi\Nto return my wallet immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had about 500,000 yen, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.18,0:12:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I would like to be paid back in full.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good heavens! How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,500,000?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get your game now, dirty con artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ko, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is nothing but a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, that's so rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.84,0:12:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to bring it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have proof that your\Nson swiped my wallet for his.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I decided to eat at Johnny's last night,\Nwhere I ordered the hamburger meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a bowl of onion\NGuardian soup on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it came out to 1,833\Nyen, but I could be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The receipt in the wallet Koichi\Nhas should clear everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was telling the truth! No, he's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You planned it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you went out and bought\Nthe same wallet to trick my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has quite the imagination,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but his habit of lying and stealing\Nis a disturbing character flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody here raised a real\Ndelinquent as his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel any guilt over his actions?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:13:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering when it would appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.66,0:14:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the weight of her guilt over her baby\Nboy turned criminal will oppress her soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bleed you dry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I'll take the house's land title\Nand seal, and we'll see what else you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.30,0:14:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a great house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When your lovely sister brought me tea,\NI got her to spill some on my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wailed to make her think she burned me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.78,0:14:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you should have seen\Nhow apologetic she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.56,0:14:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sweet and seductive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.62,0:14:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she's a junior at an\Nall-girls school. Yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.72,0:14:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fully grown and ripe\Nfor the picking. Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yah-yah-yah-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:14:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.27,0:14:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, I'll make you pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.76,0:15:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that funny-looking\Negg thing supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.10,0:15:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you two, you need to\Nleave the room right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got this, but you have to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.64,0:15:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what that thing\Nis, but get it away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have gotten your mom\Nand sister out of the room,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they're still my hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as long as they are, you have to\Ndo what I say, so call off your beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.34,0:15:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grrgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hate to break it to you, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're not getting anywhere\Nnear my mother or sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.35,0:15:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you worse then, Keicho!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're a Bites and just jimmy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you take the locks off my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a smart boy, Keicho!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about what it\Nwould do to your mother
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:15:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if she saw you beating the shit out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her guilt would be all-consuming\Nand swallow her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to remove the locks now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.32,0:16:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you're talking\Nto, you sawed-off little dickhead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Tamami Kobayashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not taking off the locks\Nuntil I'm good and ready!
