Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend's bark is a\Nlot worse than his bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of stand is that, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I can see, it's just a\Nposer without any speed or power!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you scare me over nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time I taught you a lesson.
