Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.06,0:17:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand is the ability to fill the body\Nwith sound and turn it into a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.87,0:17:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we studied a famous Matsuo Basho\Npoem just like this in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something about the trill of the\Nlocusts permeating through stone.
