Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason I'm such a boss-ass conman is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I don't cave\Nin to upstart pizzants!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Tamami, and the Tama stands for balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're about to see how big mine are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.42,0:18:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared of that\Nknife or your tiny balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep underestimating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.56,0:18:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you a whole new\Nworld of horror and pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes the agony of the padlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, no! Ko!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.74,0:19:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only is the cut shallow, but the\Npain and panic is fake! Toss! Toss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's screaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.45,0:19:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ko? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.61,0:19:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lock's got bigger! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ko! Why, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.94,0:19:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did I go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.39,0:19:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to know I didn't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.63,0:19:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.55,0:19:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Told you you couldn't beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and get rid of this\Nracket, Koichi, or your mom's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want the guilt to\Ncross your mom into a pancake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.60,0:19:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when a person is wracked with this much\Nguilt, death seems like a sweet release.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over! Mom, don't! No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.84,0:19:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't live like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your turn to stop being a tough guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next to sound, you're gonna watch your\Nmom paint the room with her blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I don't think I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make it worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.00,0:20:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me!
