Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.14,0:20:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's too far gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.53,0:20:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll never believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.44,0:20:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.35,0:20:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.26,0:20:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on. Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If his own mother won't\Nbelieve him, then who will?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to have faith in my darling boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always been such a perfect angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd never hurt a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know in my heart\Nhe'd never steal. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.60,0:20:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.84,0:20:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parents never trust their brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least mine never trusted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what makes him special?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.74,0:20:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.42,0:21:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Ko, surely you wouldn't\Nkill a guy over a joke, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the lock off my sister, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.52,0:21:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already taken care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.32,0:21:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never do anything to\Nharm such a picturesque face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.02,0:21:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so you know, I was only\Nkidding about taking your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.38,0:21:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even gave you back all\Nof your yen. See? Joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything, Master Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.51,0:21:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll do anything I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.62,0:21:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! Just name it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be your personal underling!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.58,0:21:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.49,0:21:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.26,0:21:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your first duty is to bring\Nme 500 grand by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.62,0:21:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you recognize your\Njoke when you hear one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.86,0:21:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That didn't sound like a joke to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.62,0:22:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, Okuyasu, is it just me\Nor is that guy really creepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.52,0:22:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, allow me to carry your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.86,0:22:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.04,0:22:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.22,0:22:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Koichi, you're a true\Nman among men! Aw, shucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to buy — I swear,\Nit's like we're in the Twilight Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what that means, but my brain\Nhurts just watching all this weirdness.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.88,0:22:52.26,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.98,0:22:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anytime I need to see a\Nface, it has closed my eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.26,0:22:54.51,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.50,0:22:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am taken to a base\Nwith a crystal mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.51,0:22:57.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.72,0:22:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A magenta feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.94,0:22:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a shelter in the face of my spine.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.31,0:22:58.98,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:22:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straight like a chicken cherry cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.94,0:23:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to try to explain.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.98,0:23:01.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hold on tight.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.35,0:23:03.73,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it happens again,\NI'ma move so slightly.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.73,0:23:06.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.88,0:23:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the arms and the lips and the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.50,0:23:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the humic and the ball that I need to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.53,0:23:08.24,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.50,0:23:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.41,0:23:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come stand a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.49,0:23:12.82,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.82,0:23:14.45,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.45,0:23:17.08,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.02,0:23:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you. I don't\Nknow if I need you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.08,0:23:21.58,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.58,0:23:25.13,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.08,0:23:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I got to find out.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.13,0:23:30.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.40,0:23:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.59,0:23:33.97,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I got to find out.
